:"https://api.github.com/users/hulien22/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hulien22/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hulien22/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hulien22/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hulien22/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hulien22/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hulien22/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hulien22/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-05-26T06:09:47Z","updated_at":"2023-06-10T07:55:28Z","body":"Script that repros this issue locally. Passes before be5d3e937205845de334b0a12c2a59c262acf6a4, but fails after that commit\r\n```\r\n#!/bin/bash\r\n\r\nbin/yb-ctl wipe_restart --data_dir /tmp/yb1 --ip_start 1 --master_flags \"enable_automatic_tablet_splitting=true,tablet_split_high_phase_shard_count_per_node=576,tablet_split_high_phase_size_threshold_bytes=10485760,tablet_split_low_phase_shard_count_per_node=96,tablet_split_low_phase_size_threshold_bytes=1048576,db_write_buffer_size=102400\" --tserver_flags \"db_write_buffer_size=102400\"\r\nbin/yb-ctl wipe_restart --data_dir /tmp/yb2 --ip_start 5 --master_flags \"enable_automatic_tablet_splitting=true,tablet_split_high_phase_shard_count_per_node=576,tablet_split_high_phase_size_threshold_bytes=10485760,tablet_split_low_phase_shard_count_per_node=96,tablet_split_low_phase_size_threshold_bytes=1048576,db_write_buffer_size=102400\" --tserver_flags \"db_write_buffer_size=102400\"\r\n\r\nbin/ysqlsh -h 127.0.0.1 -c \"create database jhe\"\r\nbin/ysqlsh -h 127.0.0.1 -d jhe -c \"create table test(i int primary key, v text)\"\r\nbin/ysqlsh -h 127.0.0.5 -c \"create database jhe\"\r\nbin/ysqlsh -h 127.0.0.5 -d jhe -c \"create table test(i int primary key, v text)\"\r\n\r\nbuild/latest/bin/yb-admin -master_addresses=127.0.0.5 setup_universe_replication test 127.0.0.1 00004000000030008000000000004001\r\nbuild/latest/bin/yb-admin -master_addresses=127.0.0.1 setup_universe_replication test 127.0.0.5 00004000000030008000000000004001\r\n\r\nbin/ysqlsh -h 127.0.0.1 -d jhe -c  \"insert into test select id, repeat('x',5000) from generate_series(1,10000) id;\"\r\n\r\nsleep 10\r\n\r\nbin/ysqlsh -h 127.0.0.1 -d jhe -c \"select count(*) from test\"\r\nbin/ysqlsh -h 127.0.0.5 -d jhe -c \"select count(*) from test\"\r\n\r\nbin/ysqlsh -h 127.0.0.5 -d jhe -c  \"insert into test select id, repeat('x',5000) from generate_series(10001,20000) id;\"\r\n\r\nsleep 10\r\n\r\nbin/ysqlsh -h 127.0.0.1 -d jhe -c \"select count(*) from test\"\r\nbin/ysqlsh -h 127.0.0.5 -d jhe -c \"select count(*) from test\"\r\n```\r\n\r\nNOTE: This also triggers the issue if tablet splitting is not enabled!! The issue has to do with external writes taking up an entire batch when reading from the secondary producer ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/comments/1563856905/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"hulien22","id":32774836,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNzc0ODM2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32774836?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hulien22","html_url":"https://github.com/hulien22","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hulien22/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hulien22/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hulien22/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hulien22/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hulien22/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hulien22/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hulien22/repos","events_url":"https://api.githu